// Title: UAC Bypass Using Windows Media Player - File
// Rule ID: 68578b43-65df-4f81-9a9b-92f32711a951
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Category: file_event
